  "checks_completed": [
    "Exact original Workspace/source import, current grid/profile/scenario/observation, customer review and portable return contracts read and source-reviewed.",
    "CLI existing export uses reviews.describe_export, preserving original response generation.",
    "Snapshot primary and all companions stay in one native source view, preserving relative document and original sidecar links.",
    "Requested resolution/count become visible review findings; original run actions remain independent.",
    "Provider preview verifies and removes only the current server's workspace transport field before strict scientific selection normalization.",
    "Capture/import and final setup publication share the existing Workspace lock; original review creation takes its own lock without nesting.",
    "Native request admission decodes, hashes and retains one original byte read.",
    "Reused Workspace archive must match its retained bytes/SHA receipt; interrupted receipt recovery uses portable.inspect_archive(verify=True).",
    "Peer inspection by source_engineering confirms original review source selection preserves all relative companion links and stable captured_at preserves source identity across retries.",
    "Setup question/notes match the original review core's20,000-character limits; text NULs are rejected before source capture."
  ],
